{"id":"encantado","lemma":"encantado","pos":"adj","rank":984,"glosses":["enchanted, charmed","pleased, delighted","thrilled, overjoyed"],"ipa":"/enkanˈtado/","forms":{"feminine":"encantada","masculinePlural":"encantados","femininePlural":"encantadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Wikipedian-walker-encantado.wav","examples":[{"text":"Estaría encantado de ir en tu lugar.","en":"I'd be glad to go in your place.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/615988","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"place"}]},{"text":"La casa está encantada.","en":"The house is haunted.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38563","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"house"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null]},{"text":"Me ha encantado su forma de cantar.","en":"I really liked his style of singing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687539","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"shape"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to sing"}]},{"text":"Tom piensa que su casa está encantada.","en":"Tom thinks his house is haunted.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/306546","words":[null,{"g":"to think, ponder","l":"pensar"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"house"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null]},{"text":"Estaba encantado de ayudar.","en":"I was glad to help.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448862","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to help"}]}]}